---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import GoldenSpiral from '../components/GoldenSpiral.astro';
import MeteorShower from '../components/MeteorShower.astro';
import TerminalQuote from '../components/TerminalQuote.astro';

const nowText =
	'Now: Preparing for an internship at a research institute, while building an intelligent hotel management system on the side.';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me - 四季折雨"
	description="天天开心."
	pubDate={new Date('Feb 10 2026')}
	metaMode="page"
	heroImage="https://tc.ixoxi.cn/file/四时小路komichi/1788071101167_IMG_7456.GIF"
	profileImage="https://tc.ixoxi.cn/file/四时小路komichi/1788071098958_e76af026d81972375008b8d920608dc7.jpg"
>
	<Fragment slot="background">
		<GoldenSpiral />
		<MeteorShower density={1.8} heightVh={60} />
	</Fragment>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
		<p>
			关于为什么做这个博客的初衷
		</p>

		<h2>Focus</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>还没决定好，先记录我喜欢的东西吧+</li>
			<li>关注<a href="https://space.bilibili.com/1512246445?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">四时小路komichi</a>谢谢喵+</li>
			<li>
				好听的曲目
				<a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1q8Mq6dE7Q/?spm_id_from=333.1387.0.0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">⛔️⚠️!!!CHO-DARI-️!!!⚠️⛔️</a>
			</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Now</h2>
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-left">
			<TerminalQuote text={nowText} once={true} fixedHeight={false} />
		</div>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>
			待添加
			<button type="button" class="contact-link" data-modal-toggle="contact">四十小路</button>
			ovo.
		</p>
	</div>
</Layout>

<script>
	document.querySelectorAll('.contact-link').forEach(btn => {
		btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
			const event = new CustomEvent('open-contact-modal');
			window.dispatchEvent(event);
		});
	});
</script>
